  message: "P2 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 24d0b860ee; owner-requested re-check of the 51 open P2 violated/todo_hard/todo_soft items; fixtures and outputs under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p2_review_11012026/C1/). VERDICT: CURRENT by code read (no cold embedding run; the 433 count not re-measured). sketch.py:4604 _select_additional_files; candidates = every non-source, non-excluded file (:4677-4687); :4708-4713 batch_embed_files(candidate_files, ...) embeds ALL of them when _has_sentence_transformers(); semantic_top_n=10 (call :7132) and the budget-derived max_files (:7103) apply afterwards; survey's cached_centrality_scores (cli.py:13548) is used for ranking only (:4733-4738), never to pre-filter. Embeddings are content-hash cached, so only a cold run pays; INV-gujus (9679de97c5) changed fetch policy only, and this box has the weights. MECHANISM: rank-then-truncate - the expensive per-candidate score is computed over the full set before any cheap pre-filter or the display budget (singleton). Status unchanged."  # 440b
